  {
   "id": "01a1d002-0000-7000-8000-000000c9d77e",
   "short_hash": "0c9d77e",
   "body": "Spent the morning chasing a flaky test. Long story, so here goes.\nIt only failed on CI, only on Tuesdays, and only when the cache was warm.\nTurned out the fixture used the weekday to pick a timezone. Nobody remembers why.\nRetried it forty times with the cache cold. Green every time.\nWarmed the cache, set the clock to a Tuesday: red.\nPinned the timezone in the fixture and deleted the weekday logic.\nMoral: never let a test read the clock. Write-up at https://example.org/flaky-tuesdays",
   "body_segments": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Spent the morning chasing a flaky test. Long story, so here goes.\nIt only failed on CI, only on Tuesdays, and only when the cache was warm.\nTurned out the fixture used the weekday to pick a timezone. Nobody remembers why.\nRetried it forty times with the cache cold. Green every time.\nWarmed the cache, set the clock to a Tuesday: red.\nPinned the timezone in the fixture and deleted the weekday logic.\nMoral: never let a test read the clock. Write-up at https://example.org/flaky-tuesdays"
    }
   ],
